msgid "On Render Layers: switch on the view-layer passes needed for the reconstruction (requires a re-render)"
msgstr "在渲染层上：开启重建所需的视图层通道（需要重新渲染）"

#: operators.py:40
#: operators.py:422
msgid "Pass AO / Depth / Normal / Vector / Mist / Index … through as named group outputs"
msgstr "将 AO / 深度 / 法线 / 矢量 / 雾 / 索引…作为命名的组输出传递"

#: operators.py:30
#: operators.py:412
msgid "Put a copy of the Render Layers / EXR node inside the LayerCake group so it is fully self-contained, instead of feeding it from the outside"
msgstr "在 LayerCake 组内放置渲染层 / EXR 节点的副本，使其完全自包含，而不是从外部输入"

#: operators.py:767
msgid "Remove All"
msgstr "全部移除"

#: operators.py:767
msgid "Remove every LayerCake in the tree, not just the selected one"
msgstr "移除节点树中的所有 LayerCake，而不仅是选中的那个"

#: ui.py:85
msgid "Render Layers or multilayer EXR"
msgstr "渲染层或多层 EXR"

#: operators.py:483
msgid "Select a Render Layers / EXR node, or a LayerCake group to update."
msgstr "选择渲染层 / EXR 节点，或要更新的 LayerCake 组。"

