msgid "When run on the scene's top compositor, route Combined to the Group Output (single source only — with several sources the output is ambiguous)"
msgstr "在场景顶层合成器上运行时，将合并连接到组输出（仅限单一源——多个源时输出不明确）"

#: operators.py:60
